<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Bahrain Cinema H1 97 net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bahrain Cinema H1 97 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			(million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.31    vs    0.20</p>
<p> Operating income     0.73    vs    0.54</p>
<p> Expenses		 0.40    vs    0.29</p>
<p> Net operating income 0.33    vs    0.25</p>
<p> Other income	   0.21    vs    0.19</p>
<p> Assets		   3.75    vs    3.64</p>
<p>Full Name: Bahrain Cinema Company.</p>
<p>Note - The firm is traded on the Bahrain Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
